> ### Changes in the Script:
> 
> 1. **Backup Creation:** Before the deployment, the script creates a backup of the entire project folder to a designated backup path on DreamHost with a timestamp in the folder name.
> 
> 2. **Last Updated File:** After the update, it writes the current date and time to a "last updated" file on the server.
> 
> 3. **URL Check:** It checks if the content returned by the URL matches the string "updated". If not, it exits with a failure code.
> 
> 4. **Rollback Logic:** If there is an error (detected by the trap), it removes the current project files and restores the backup. 
> 
> 5. **Mac OS Notification:** It sends a Mac OS popup notification if the deployment fails.
